counting_sort.lean](file:///home/user/lean_project/Veribench/counting_sort.lean#L508-L629)):\n   - `Post_prop` combining the specification properties of `counting_sort`.\n   - Randomized `Plausible.Testable.check` PBTs and bounded `native_decide` PBTs covering each property and `Post_prop`.\n   - `counting_sort_correct` / `correctness_thm` proving `Pre arr → Post_prop arr`.\n5. **Imperative Implementation and Equivalence Proof** ([counting_sort.lean](file:///home/user/lean_project/Veribench/counting_sort.lean#L631-L699)):\n   - `counting_sort_imp` implemented with `Id.run do` and mutable state (`max_val`, `min_val`, `count`, `result`), imperative unit/PBT checks, and the proved equivalence theorem `equiv_thm` (`counting_sort arr = counting_sort_imp arr`)."}
